draft: DRAFT-libgit2-1.9.0-owner-validation-hmdfs
status: pending-editor-review
id: DRAFT-libgit2-owner-validation
doc_file: DRAFT-libgit2-1.9.0-owner-validation-hmdfs.md
title: libgit2 (>=1.7) 仓库目录属主安全校验（GIT_OPT_SET_OWNER_VALIDATION）在 HMDFS 共享属主文件系统上误判——用 git_libgit2_opts 关闭库 API 层校验
category: platform, hmdfs, libgit2, security, cross-compile
match_keywords: >
  not owned by current user, GIT_OPT_SET_OWNER_VALIDATION, GIT_OPT_GET_OWNER_VALIDATION,
  git_libgit2_opts, git_repository_init, git_repository_open, safe.directory,
  repository path, HMDFS, shared uid, owner validation, libgit2
error_signature: >
  git_repository_init failed: repository path '.*' is not owned by current user|
  Function call succeeded: git_repository_init.*(?:unwriteable|owned)|not owned by current user
root_cause: >
  libgit2 1.7+ 引入仓库目录属主安全校验（与 git safe.directory 等价的库 API 层
  机制，include/git2/common.h GIT_OPT_SET_OWNER_VALIDATION 默认开启）：打开/新建
  仓库时校验目录属主与当前 euid 一致。OHOS 沙箱及 HMDFS（/storage 共享属主
  文件系统）上目录属主恒为共享 uid（如 file_manager 20001006），与进程 euid
  不一致，导致本可正常创建的目录被误判"不属当前用户"，git_repository_init/
  open 返回错误。
solution: |
  # test_package / 消费者适配：初始化后显式关闭属主校验（库 API 层）
  git_libgit2_init();
  git_libgit2_opts(GIT_OPT_SET_OWNER_VALIDATION, 0);  /* HMDFS 共享属主语义 */
  git_repository_init(&repo, path, 0);
  # 校验：GIT_OPT_GET_OWNER_VALIDATION 读回 0；仓库创建/打开成功
verify_builds: "libgit2-1.9.0-r01-pc4-30 (conan-verify G2 PASS; ohos-special commit 50963e2d read-back OK)"
reference_impl: >
  libgit2 1.9.0（archives/l/libgit2/1.9.0/test_package/test.c 为库内可复现
  消费者适配实例；另在适配期以独立 ohos-special 用例验证 blob→index→tree→
  commit 写回路 exit 0）；与 E101（git CLI safe.directory）同根因族（HMDFS
  UID），本条为库 API 层，E101 为命令层
last_updated: 2026-09-18